       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INVMGR.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-ITEM-CODE  PIC X(5)   VALUE "APPLE".
       01 WS-ITEM-QTY   PIC 9(4)   VALUE 0.
       01 WS-ITEM-PRICE PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 1.50.
       01 WS-RESTOCK    PIC 9(4)   VALUE 100.
       01 WS-TOTAL-VAL  PIC 9(8)V99 VALUE 0.
       01 WS-LOW-THRESH PIC 9(4)   VALUE 10.
       01 WS-STATUS     PIC X(10)  VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE 50 TO WS-ITEM-QTY.
           PERFORM CALC-TOTAL.
           IF WS-ITEM-QTY < WS-LOW-THRESH
               DISPLAY "LOW STOCK: " WS-ITEM-CODE
               MOVE "RESTOCK" TO WS-STATUS
               PERFORM RESTOCK-ITEM
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "IN STOCK: " WS-ITEM-CODE
               MOVE "OK" TO WS-STATUS
           END-IF.
           DISPLAY "QTY: " WS-ITEM-QTY.
           DISPLAY "VAL: " WS-TOTAL-VAL.
           DISPLAY "STS: " WS-STATUS.
           GOBACK.
       CALC-TOTAL.
           COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-VAL = WS-ITEM-QTY * WS-ITEM-PRICE.
       RESTOCK-ITEM.
           ADD WS-RESTOCK TO WS-ITEM-QTY.
           PERFORM CALC-TOTAL.
